=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Bane_(enchantment)\" title=\"Bane (enchantment)\">Lesser&#32;Monstrous Humanoid Bane</a>:</b> A bane weapon excels at attacking one type or subtype of creature. Against Monstrous Humanoids, this weapon's effective enhancement bonus is +1 better than its normal enhancement bonus. It deals an extra 1 to 6 points of damage against the foe.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Molin%27s_Great_Axe.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Molin%27s_Great_Axe.png/420px-Molin%27s_Great_Axe.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"368\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Molin%27s_Great_Axe.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>Used by Molin, a young dwarf adventurer, this big, heavy, double-bladed axe is wieldable only with two hands. It is said to haunt the dreams of the Sahuagin.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span></li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817222552\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.079 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.148 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3844/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 24722/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6141/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 32/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 13/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n108.86%  145.049     41 Template:IO\n100.00%  133.247      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  133.247      1 -total\n 95.50%  127.245      1 Template:Named_Weapon\n 40.41%   53.843      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 39.03%   52.004      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 35.30%   47.032      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 33.57%   44.729      2 Template:InCategory\n 16.14%   21.511      1 Template:Non-food\n 15.54%   20.711      3 Template:Popup\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:9548-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817222552 and revision id 633516. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
